      "content": {
        "en": "The electromagnetic spectrum is organized into 7 standardized bands, ordered by increasing frequency and photon energy:\n\n• Radio Waves (λ: 10⁵ m to 1 m | f: 3 kHz to 300 MHz | E: peV to μeV):\nProduced by macroscopic LC oscillating circuits and AC currents in metal antenna rods. Non-ionizing.\n\n• Microwaves (λ: 1 m to 1 mm | f: 300 MHz to 300 GHz | E: μeV to meV):\nProduced by relativistic electron beam tube oscillators and semiconductor avalanche diodes. Interacts strongly with molecular rotational states (e.g. 2.45 GHz water resonance).\n\n• Infrared (λ: 1 mm to 750 nm | f: 300 GHz to 400 THz | E: meV to 1.65 eV):\nRadiated by molecular vibrations and thermal kinetic motion of atoms in all warm matter. Detected via bolometers and microbolometer focal plane arrays.\n\n• Visible Light (λ: 750 nm to 380 nm | f: 400 THz to 790 THz | E: 1.65 eV to 3.26 eV):\nSpans Red (700 nm) to Violet (400 nm). Peak human eye sensitivity occurs at 555 nm (green-yellow).\n\n• Ultraviolet (λ: 380 nm to 10 nm | f: 790 THz to 30 PHz | E: 3.26 eV to 124 eV):\nExcites valence electrons; ionizing for λ < 120 nm. Solar UV is categorized into UV-A, UV-B (sunburn), and UV-C (germicidal).\n\n• X-rays (λ: 10 nm to 0.01 nm | f: 30 PHz to 30 EHz | E: 124 eV to 124 keV):\nProduced by bombarding tungsten anodes with high-speed electrons (Bremsstrahlung) and inner core electron transitions (K-shell). Highly ionizing.\n\n• Gamma Rays (λ < 0.01 nm | f > 30 EHz | E > 124 keV):\nProduced during nuclear de-excitation transitions, supernova collapses, and particle-antiparticle annihilation. Maximum penetrating power.",
        "hi": "स्पेक्ट्रम के 7 मुख्य भाग:\n1. रेडियो: 3 kHz - 300 MHz (एंटेना से संचालित)\n2. माइक्रोवेव: 300 MHz - 300 GHz (वाई-फाई, रडार)\n3. अवरक्त: 300 GHz - 400 THz (तापीय कंपन)\n4. दृश्य: 400 THz - 790 THz (380 - 750 nm)\n5. पराबैंगनी: 790 THz - 30 PHz (UV-A, B, C)\n6. एक्स-रे: 30 PHz - 30 EHz (ब्रेमस्ट्रालुंग)\n7. गामा किरणें: > 30 EHz (नाभिकीय विघटन)",
        "bn": "বর্ণালীর ৭টি প্রধান অঞ্চল:\n১. রেডিও: ৩ kHz - ৩০০ MHz (অ্যান্টেনায় মুক্ত ইলেকট্রন)\n২. মাইক্রোওয়েভ: ৩০০ MHz - ৩০০ GHz (রাডার ও ওয়াই-ফাই)\n৩. অবলোহিত: ৩০০ GHz - ৪০০ THz (আণবিক তাপীয় কম্পন)\n৪. দৃশ্যমান: ৪০০ THz - ৭৯০ THz (৩৮০ - ৭৫০ nm)\n৫. অতিবেগুনি: ৭৯০ THz - ৩০ PHz (UV-A, B, C)\n৬. এক্স-রে: ৩০ PHz - ৩০ EHz (ব্রেকিং বিকিরণ)\n৭. গামা রশ্মি: > ৩০ EHz (নিউক্লিয়ার ক্ষয়)"
      },
